{
  "name": "WhatsApp sales chatbot with human handoff (WebzzConnect)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "ba072b25-1961-4cc5-b03a-0c46460dc7c1",
      "name": "Note 0",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -420,
        -40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WhatsApp sales chatbot with human handoff\n\n**Setup**\n1. In WebzzConnect, create an account API key (Settings > API keys) named like a bot, e.g. \"Sales bot\", with the scopes conversations:reply and conversations:resolve.\n2. Add it as a WebzzConnect API credential and select it on every WebzzConnect node.\n3. In **New message**, pick your WhatsApp inbox.\n4. Edit the texts, the pricing link and the demo slots, then activate the workflow.\n\n**How it stops for people**\nAny reply by a person (dashboard or the WhatsApp Business app) labels the conversation `human`, and the bot stays quiet there. Remove the label to hand the chat back to the bot.\n\nUse an API key, not OAuth: messages sent through OAuth show you as the sender and look like a human reply.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 620
      }
    },
